@startuml
[*] --> Start

Start --> ViewProfile : View Profile
Start --> AddProfile : Add Profile

ViewProfile --> EditProfile : Edit Profile
ViewProfile --> DeleteProfile : Delete Profile
ViewProfile --> CustomizeProfile : Customize Profile
ViewProfile --> Start : Back to Start

AddProfile --> Start : Back to Start
AddProfile --> ViewProfile : View Added Profile

EditProfile --> Start : Back to Start
EditProfile --> ViewProfile : View Edited Profile

DeleteProfile --> Start : Back to Start
DeleteProfile --> ViewProfile : View Remaining Profiles

CustomizeProfile --> Start : Back to Start
CustomizeProfile --> ViewProfile : View Customized Profile

ViewProfile --> ReceiveNotification : Receive Notification
ReceiveNotification --> Start : Back to Start
ReceiveNotification --> ViewProfile : View Profile Again

ViewProfile --> [*] : Exit
AddProfile --> [*] : Exit
EditProfile --> [*] : Exit
DeleteProfile --> [*] : Exit
CustomizeProfile --> [*] : Exit
ReceiveNotification --> [*] : Exit
@enduml
